592186045417] [17592186318563 #edb/ref 1077 "field-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186318563 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186504211 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186318563 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "426b9925-da9c-542a-ad67-7fc57c5f23ac" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186318638 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186317933 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186318638 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186318638 #edb/ref 1077 "field-2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186318638 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186317933 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186318638 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "63c576f3-9bcb-5562-aebb-a9f68a0ffa05" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186318954 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186318396 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186318954 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186318954 #edb/ref 1077 "field-2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186318954 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186318396 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186318954 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "fde9f548-1427-5fca-b7bf-a0e28dfaf74b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186319077 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186318563 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186319077 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186318954 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186319077 #edb/ref 1069 "q-346190" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186319077 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186319077 #edb/ref 1071 "Find the function $f(x)$ and the value of $b,$ given that\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{2}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{k=0}^{n-1}[5{(2+\\frac{4k}{n})}^{3}\\cdot \\frac{4}{n}].\n$$\n\n$\\,f(x)=$\n{{field-1}} $\\,$ and \n$\\,b=$\n{{field-2}}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186319077 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "91c3be0f-8f8e-52a1-9627-d3cf3af82a0a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186319077 #edb/ref 1074 "A definite integral can be defined as the limit of a left Riemann sum as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{k=0}^{n-1}f({x}_{k})\\cdot Δx\n$$\n\nwhere $Δx=\\frac{b-a}{n}$ and ${x}_{k}=a+kΔx.$\n\nNotice that we're given that the lower limit $a=2.$ \n\nComparing the given summation with the general expression above, we see that $Δx=\\frac{4}{n}.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{n}=\\frac{b-2}{n}\\,⟹\\,b=6.\n$$\n\nConsequently, ${x}_{k}=2+\\frac{4k}{n}$ and $f({x}_{k})=5{x}_{k}^{3}.$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{2}^{6}5{x}^{3}\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{k=0}^{n-1}[5{(2+\\frac{4k}{n})}^{3}\\cdot \\frac{4}{n}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \n\n$$\nf(x)=5{x}^{3}\\,\\text{and}\\,b=6.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186319081 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186318550 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186319081 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186318638 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186319081 #edb/ref 1069 "q-346201" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186319081 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186319081 #edb/ref 1071 "Find the function $f(x)$ and the value of $b,$ given that\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-1}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{k=0}^{n-1}[{((-1+\\frac{3k}{n})+8)}^{1/3}\\cdot \\frac{3}{n}].\n$$\n\n$\\,f(x)=$\n{{field-1}} $\\,$ and \n$\\,b=$\n{{field-2}}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186319081 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "c0de2e03-fab0-563b-b613-a64d3498b437" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186319081 #edb/ref 1074 "A definite integral can be defined as the limit of a left Riemann sum as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{k=0}^{n-1}f({x}_{k})\\cdot Δx\n$$\n\nwhere $Δx=\\frac{b-a}{n}$ and ${x}_{k}=a+kΔx.$\n\nNotice that we're given that the lower limit $a=-1.$ \n\nComparing the given summation with the general expression above, we see that $Δx=\\frac{3}{n}.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{n}=\\frac{b-(-1)}{n}\\,⟹\\,b=2.\n$$\n\nConsequently, ${x}_{k}=-1+\\frac{3k}{n}$ and $f({x}_{k})=({x}_{k}+8{)}^{1/3}.$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-1}^{2}(x+8{)}^{1/3}\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{k=0}^{n-1}[{((-1+\\frac{3k}{n})+8)}^{1/3}\\cdot \\frac{3}{n}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \n\n$$\nf(x)=(x+8{)}^{1/3}\\,\\text{and}\\,b=2.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186330118 #edb/ref 1080 "$f(x)=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+e)$ and $b={e}^{2}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186330118 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186330118 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1520edf6-93bb-5db6-9128-f81756520d8d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186330413 #edb/ref 1080 "$f(x)=\\operatorname{ln}⁡x$ and $b={e}^{2}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186330413 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186330413 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "34612814-166e-5d51-b2d8-255a56c01f3f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186330759 #edb/ref 1080 "$f(x)=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+e)$ and $b=2e$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186330759 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186330759 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "5a4d58cd-e443-52da-913e-f6feabf466de" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186331234 #edb/ref 1080 "$f(x)=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+e)$ and $b=e+1$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186331234 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186331234 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "90479fe6-a4ca-56f9-9289-46966e3a10b8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186332011 #edb/ref 1080 "$f(x)=\\operatorname{ln}⁡x$ and $b=2e$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186332011 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186332011 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "eafb8eca-ec9c-5930-b366-56e28ce03054" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186332271 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186330118 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186332271 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186330413 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186332271 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186330759 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186332271 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186331234 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186332271 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186332011 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186332271 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 1759218604